The solve itself is Gauss-Jordan elimination with partial pivoting on the correlation matrix:
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
//| CFeatureNeutralizer::GaussJordanSolve                            |
//| Solve A x = b for the n x n system built by Fit(). A is a        |
//| correlation matrix (unit diagonal), so the pivot size is the     |
